  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Lesotho University Innovation Pod (Lesotho UniPod) will be delivered as a collaborative initiative between UNDP Lesotho and the local institutions of higher learning, to advance innovations and use of technology for creating opportunities for economic growth and diversification in the country. The programme will be implemented through an innovation pod, hosted at the Lerotholi Polytechnic, to provide platform, technologies, and technical support to allow them to ideate, collaborate, develop,</narrative>
  </description>
